subckt tcoil (n1 n2 n3)
parameters l1=1n l2=1n k=1 cb=1p
L1 (n1 n3) inductor l=l1
L2 (n3 n2) inductor l=l2
K12 mutual_inductor coupling=k ind1=L1 ind2=L2
CB (n1 n2) capacitor c=cb
ends tcoil

subckt dut (VDD VSS Vinp Vinn)
C1 (net2 VSS) capacitor c=1p
CL (Vinn VSS) capacitor c=1p
LS (net2 net1) inductor l=1n
M1 (net2 Vinp VSS VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
RD (VDD net0) resistor r=1k
X2 (net1 net0 Vinn) tcoil l1=1n l2=1n k=1 cb=1p
